(text "LCD backlight draft: 5V_SYS -> 22R/0.5W -> LEDA, based on matching 3.2in 18-pin panel (3.1V typ, 90mA typ). Verify actual purchased panel before fab." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 190.50 110.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))) (uuid "c4927bb2-4096-4ee8-9a41-27abe086bc34"))



































































































































































































